#: ../../source/reference/shortcuts.rst:2
msgid "Keyboard Shortcuts"
msgstr "键盘快捷键"

#: ../../source/reference/shortcuts.rst:4
msgid ""
"The bindings below are the default bindings on Windows and Linux. ``Mod``"
" means ``Ctrl`` on Windows and Linux, and ``Cmd`` on macOS if you run a "
"compatible build. You can change them from **Settings > Keyboard "
"shortcuts**."
msgstr ""
"下面列出的是 Windows 和 Linux 上的默认绑定。``Mod`` 在 Windows 和 Linux 上表示 "
"``Ctrl``，如果运行兼容版本，在 macOS 上表示 ``Cmd``。你可以从 **Settings > Keyboard "
"shortcuts** 修改它们。"

#: ../../source/reference/shortcuts.rst:12
msgid "Action"
msgstr "操作"

#: ../../source/reference/shortcuts.rst:13
msgid "Default binding"
msgstr "默认绑定"

#: ../../source/reference/shortcuts.rst:14
msgid "Purpose"
msgstr "用途"

#: ../../source/reference/shortcuts.rst:15
msgid "Toggle workspace sidebar"
msgstr "切换工作区侧栏"

#: ../../source/reference/shortcuts.rst:16
msgid "``Ctrl+B``"
msgstr "``Ctrl+B``"

#: ../../source/reference/shortcuts.rst:17
msgid "Show or hide the workspace tree."
msgstr "显示或隐藏工作区树。"

#: ../../source/reference/shortcuts.rst:18
msgid "Toggle bottom panel"
msgstr "切换底部面板"

#: ../../source/reference/shortcuts.rst:19
msgid "``Ctrl+J``"
msgstr "``Ctrl+J``"

#: ../../source/reference/shortcuts.rst:20
msgid "Show or hide terminal and other bottom panels."
msgstr "显示或隐藏终端和其他底部面板。"

#: ../../source/reference/shortcuts.rst:21
msgid "Toggle session sidebar"
msgstr "切换会话侧栏"

#: ../../source/reference/shortcuts.rst:22
msgid "``Ctrl+Alt+B``"
msgstr "``Ctrl+Alt+B``"

#: ../../source/reference/shortcuts.rst:23
msgid "Show or hide the session-side panel."
msgstr "显示或隐藏会话侧边面板。"

#: ../../source/reference/shortcuts.rst:24
msgid "New session"
msgstr "新会话"

#: ../../source/reference/shortcuts.rst:25
msgid "``Ctrl+N``"
msgstr "``Ctrl+N``"

#: ../../source/reference/shortcuts.rst:26
msgid "Create a session in the current workspace."
msgstr "在当前工作区创建会话。"

#: ../../source/reference/shortcuts.rst:27
msgid "Previous session"
msgstr "上一个会话"

#: ../../source/reference/shortcuts.rst:28
msgid "``Ctrl+PageUp``"
msgstr "``Ctrl+PageUp``"

#: ../../source/reference/shortcuts.rst:29
msgid "Move to the previous session."
msgstr "移动到上一个会话。"

#: ../../source/reference/shortcuts.rst:30
msgid "Next session"
msgstr "下一个会话"

#: ../../source/reference/shortcuts.rst:31
msgid "``Ctrl+PageDown``"
msgstr "``Ctrl+PageDown``"

#: ../../source/reference/shortcuts.rst:32
msgid "Move to the next session."
msgstr "移动到下一个会话。"

#: ../../source/reference/shortcuts.rst:33
msgid "Previous conversation turn"
msgstr "上一个对话轮次"

#: ../../source/reference/shortcuts.rst:34
msgid "``PageUp``"
msgstr "``PageUp``"

#: ../../source/reference/shortcuts.rst:35
msgid "Move to the previous turn."
msgstr "移动到上一个轮次。"

#: ../../source/reference/shortcuts.rst:36
msgid "Next conversation turn"
msgstr "下一个对话轮次"

#: ../../source/reference/shortcuts.rst:37
msgid "``PageDown``"
msgstr "``PageDown``"

#: ../../source/reference/shortcuts.rst:38
msgid "Move to the next turn."
msgstr "移动到下一个轮次。"

#: ../../source/reference/shortcuts.rst:39
msgid "Find in conversation"
msgstr "在对话中查找"

#: ../../source/reference/shortcuts.rst:40
msgid "``Ctrl+F``"
msgstr "``Ctrl+F``"

#: ../../source/reference/shortcuts.rst:41
msgid "Search the current conversation."
msgstr "搜索当前对话。"

#: ../../source/reference/shortcuts.rst:42
msgid "Stop computer control"
msgstr "停止计算机控制"

#: ../../source/reference/shortcuts.rst:43
msgid "``Ctrl+Alt+Esc``"
msgstr "``Ctrl+Alt+Esc``"

#: ../../source/reference/shortcuts.rst:44
msgid ""
"Immediately stop active computer control. This safety shortcut is not "
"configurable."
msgstr "立即停止活动的计算机控制。此安全快捷键不可配置。"

#: ../../source/reference/shortcuts.rst:48
msgid "Changing a binding"
msgstr "更改绑定"

#: ../../source/reference/shortcuts.rst:50
msgid "Open **Settings > Keyboard shortcuts**."
msgstr "打开 **Settings > Keyboard shortcuts**。"

#: ../../source/reference/shortcuts.rst:51
msgid "Search for the action."
msgstr "搜索操作。"

#: ../../source/reference/shortcuts.rst:52
msgid "Select the action and press the new shortcut."
msgstr "选择操作并按下新的快捷键。"

#: ../../source/reference/shortcuts.rst:53
msgid "Save the change."
msgstr "保存变更。"

#: ../../source/reference/shortcuts.rst:55
msgid ""
"Printable keys cannot be used by themselves, and Studio rejects a "
"shortcut that conflicts with another configured action. If a shortcut "
"does not work, check whether a text field or the operating system is "
"currently consuming the same key combination."
msgstr "可打印按键不能单独使用，Studio 会拒绝与其他已配置操作冲突的快捷键。如果快捷键不起作用，请检查文本字段或操作系统是否正在占用相同的按键组合。"
